FINAL_OUTPUT_SCHEMA:
{
  "patient_id": "string",
  "test_date": "YYYY-MM-DD | null",
  "exposure_feedback": {
    "symptomatic": ["canonical allergen name", ...],
    "asymptomatic": ["canonical allergen name", ...],
    "unknown_exposure": ["canonical allergen name", ...]
  }
}
Notes:
- 'canonical allergen name' should match Observation.code.coding.display or Observation.code.text.
- If patient_id or test_date are not provided by the user, set them to placeholders (e.g., "PENDING").

